- treatment_contrasts: user contrasts (set syntax "A + C vs B" or explicit
  coefficients), estimate/SE/t/CI, 1-df SS and F, standardized contrast,
  orthogonality check, order-free remainder, Bonferroni/FDR for the set.
- polynomial_contrasts: orthogonal polynomials weighted by replication,
  linear/quadratic/... SS with lack-of-fit remainder, trend coefficients.
- mean_comparisons: all pairs or vs control; LSD (+ observed FDR),
  Bonferroni, Benjamini-Hochberg, Tukey, aLSD (book, q[t-1]), Dunnett with a
  deterministic quantile (unequal replication, one- or two-sided).
- factorial_anova: optional orthogonal contrasts on factor A partition A and
  its interactions (Example 8.5).
- Catalog "text" params, bridge structured calls, i18n and messages.
- Tests against Tables 8.17, 8.19, 8.21, 8.22, 8.24, 8.25, 8.28, 8.29.

